    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A superbly located three bedroom semi-detached house with attic conversion and solar panels situated in a quiet cul-de-sac in this mature and sought after residential location.  The property comes to the market in very good condition throughout making for an ideal family home offering a blend of comfort, style and convenience. The property is situated close to all amenities and facilities in the area to include shopping centres, schools and sports clubs.  It also benefits from easy access to the N8 and M8 and other major link roads making commuting extremely convenient and is on the 208 bus route."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "GROUND FLOOR\r\nHALLWAY\r\nCeramic Tiled Floor, Radiator,  Power Points, Guest W.C., W.H.B\r\nLIVING ROOM  14.0 x 12.3                                        \r\nSemi-Solid Wood Floor, Cast Iron Fireplace,  Plumbed For Gas Fire, Radiator, Blinds, Curtains Power Points,\r\nTelephone Point.\r\nDINING ROOM  12.0 x 10.8                                                                                                                                     \r\nSemi-Solid Wood Floor, Radiator, Blinds, Curtains, Power Points, Television Point., Sliding Door To Tiled \r\nRear Patio.\r\nKITCHEN           17.0 x 10.1                                                                               \r\nCeramic Tiled Floor, Wall & Floor Units, Electric Fan Oven, 5 Burner Gas Hob, Extractor Fan, \r\nRadiator, Blinds, Power Points & USB Charger.\r\nUTILITY ROOM\r\nCeramic Tiled Floor, Plumbed for Washing Machine/Dryer, With Side Access To Garden.\r\nSTAIRS & LANDING\r\nWood Floor. Hot Press\r\nFIRST FLOOR\r\nBEDROOM 1    12.8 x 12.6                                   \r\nWood Floor, Fitted Wardrobes, Radiator, Curtains, Blinds, Power Points.\r\nEn-Suite -W.C., W.H.B., Power Shower.\r\nBEDROOM 2    10.4 x 10\r\nWood Floor, Radiator, Curtains, Blinds, Power Points , Fitted Shelving & Storage Units.\r\nBEDROOM 3    7.10 x 7.0                                                                                                                   \r\nWood Floor, Radiator, Power Points, Blinds.\r\nBATHROOM    6.8 X 6.0                                                                                                                                                              \r\nCeramic Tiled Floor, W.C., W.H.B, Electric Shower, Hot Press, Radiator, Fully Tiled.\r\nATTIC ROOM    3.2 x 12.8                                                                                                                                                                            \r\nWood Floor, Power Points, Side Attic Storage Spaces,  Black Out Blinds, 3 no. Velux Windows\r\nEn-Suite– W.C., W.H.B., Electric Shower Cubicle."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "SERVICES\r\nMains Water/Sewage, ESB, Telephone.\r\nHEATING\r\nGas Fired Central Heating System.\r\nWINDOWS/ DOORS\r\nPVC Double Glazed.\r\nOUTSIDE/OTHER\r\nTotal Floor Area: 120sq Mtrs / 1,292 Sq Ft.     \r\nSoutherly Rear Facing Garden , Fully Enclosed With Water Butt, \r\nCompost Bin, Tiled Patio & Garden Shed.\r\nAlarm System\r\n\r\nSolar Panels"
      },
